      "description": "When multiple ENABLE commands are issued, each corresponding ENABLED response SHOULD only contain extensions enabled by the corresponding ENABLE command, i.e., for the above example, the ENABLED response to \"ENABLE c\" should not contain \"a\" or \"b\".",
